fixture crouch_hop_low_ceiling
doc docs/adr/0008 (task 3 review M8): a crouched (28 u) body hopping 4 u under the low gap's ceiling is not stopped by it. The sweep read the ceiling row above the foot point's row as a floor the body had sunk into, and reported a wall in open space. This fixture asserts only the physics (no phantom wall); whether a crouched hop may move sideways is a player rule.
room test/longgap
spawn 600 544
frames 80
input
  0..2 D
  3 D dash
  4..15 R
  16 R jump
  17 R
  18 R jump
  19 R
  20 R jump
  21 R
  22 R jump
  23 R
  24 R jump
  25 R
  26 R jump
  27..79 R
end
expect
  at 15 crouch=1
  during 16..27 hit_wall=0
end
